# Working in this repo

- Every change adds one bullet to CHANGELOG.md under the `## Unreleased`
  heading, in the form `- <function name>: <what changed>`.
- Every public function is exported from its own module AND re-exported from
  src/index.js. Consumers only import from src/index.js.
- Tests use node:test, live in test/, and run with `node --test`.
